68
00:05:15.334 --> 00:05:18.344
The formal style used in universities is blank.

69
00:05:18.644 --> 00:05:24.619
A, academic register. B, fluency at C1. C, proficiency goal.

70
00:05:28.617 --> 00:05:32.184
The answer is A: academic register.

71
00:05:33.683 --> 00:05:35.544
Which sentence uses inversion?

72
00:05:35.844 --> 00:05:44.036
A, I have never seen such progress.. B, Never have I seen such progress.. C, I never saw such progress..

73
00:05:48.050 --> 00:05:52.221
The answer is B: Never have I seen such progress..

74
00:05:53.717 --> 00:05:55.867
blank I known, I would have helped.

75
00:05:56.167 --> 00:05:59.170
A, If. B, Had. C, Were.

76
00:06:03.183 --> 00:06:05.647
The answer is B: Had.

77
00:06:07.150 --> 00:06:10.090
An argument that considers complexity is a blank.

78
00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:16.621
A, nuanced argument. B, persuasive essay. C, research presentation.

79
00:06:20.617 --> 00:06:23.499
The answer is A: nuanced argument.

80
00:06:24.983 --> 00:06:28.190
