85
00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:17.467
What has been most valuable is learning to express nuance. Had I not practised hedging and register, my arguments would still sound simplistic. My goal for C2 is to write and speak with the precision of an educated native speaker.

86
00:07:17.767 --> 00:07:20.022
That is a well-argued answer!

87
00:07:21.017 --> 00:07:25.863
Great work today! You learned eight new words and c1 grammar review.

88
00:07:26.163 --> 00:07:30.139
